# DevPack environment template.
#
# Frontend (Vite): no secret environment variables are needed.
# The Supabase URL and publishable (anon) key are defined in the generated
# client at src/integrations/supabase/client.ts, so no VITE_* values are required.
#
# Optional analytics (off unless VITE_ANALYTICS_ENDPOINT is set; no cookies, no PII):
#   VITE_ANALYTICS_ENDPOINT=   # Plausible-compatible event endpoint, e.g. https://plausible.io/api/event
#   VITE_ANALYTICS_DOMAIN=     # optional site domain sent with events (defaults to the page hostname)
#
# Server-side secrets exist ONLY in Supabase edge functions (supabase/functions/),
# set with `supabase secrets set NAME=value`. They are never read by the frontend
# and must never be placed in a .env file or committed to the repository:
#
#   OPENAI_API_KEY=            # ai-generate function (narrative generation)
#   ATTOM_API_KEY=             # attom-comps function (sale comps / AVM)
#   SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY= # attom-comps function (service-role access)
#
# NEVER COMMIT real values for the keys above. Copy this file to .env.local for
# local-only overrides; .env and .env.* are gitignored.
